tinct de l’église.","es":"El padre Conmee baja los escalones de la casa parroquial de San Francisco Javier, separada de la iglesia."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"grafton","collection":"core","name":"Thornton’s","noteHash":"304708b4f75ab3ee605aff3239045ac8","positionSource":"f0e1d8c0c95e308bce55431115debdbde98b76045ec4f0fe7972ec93d4278f1a","narrativeSource":"6c940b1d84e1412edfc96c52cf9b8ac753be186c5fa579d6dd57ab973299e4dc","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"At Thornton’s, on Grafton Street, Boylan buys a gift for Molly.","it":"Da Thornton, in Grafton Street, Boylan compra un regalo per Molly.","fr":"Chez Thornton, sur Grafton Street, Boylan achète un cadeau pour Molly.","es":"En Thornton’s, en Grafton Street, Boylan compra un regalo para Molly."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"ivy","collection":"core","name":"Ivy Church / St Barnabas","noteHash":"c19ca45f716d6c1dd693fa9c0f0b08d3","positionSource":"9aa0cf8631eaef4d5ea6753f27eb6d0bd44abedfed2f62a989b69b708c1744ae","narrativeSource":"4b21d6beb743f1cd91fc18ccb38135012f4b35dd9fcf703dd46b9c08a5caf48c","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The church of St Barnabas, known as Ivy Church, is seen during the tram journey.","it":"La chiesa di St Barnabas, detta Ivy Church, compare durante il viaggio in tram.","fr":"L’église Saint-Barnabé, dite Ivy Church, apparaît pendant le trajet en tramway.","es":"La iglesia de San Bernabé, conocida como Ivy Church, aparece durante el viaje en tranvía."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"josephschool","collection":"core","name":"St Joseph’s National School","noteHash":"9e33b2ddfc347358e8194a043fe94f03","positionSource":"cf1e68475696dfaf19b42b87cb9f61ebea40190acc714a30dbeb88cab34ed244","narrativeSource":"1c37c18296b58d8899350c1aa87381d1a63002ac1a6d112d5a4fae95b2db06b7","descripti