as Moore sert de repère pendant la promenade dans le centre de Dublin.","es":"La estatua de Thomas Moore es un punto de referencia durante el paseo por el centro de Dublín."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"newcomen","collection":"core","name":"Newcomen Bridge","noteHash":"bf112775c7ca3a590a88e53cf92d5e3a","positionSource":"50d3e3a022fa8572b9c284b3a87986e7293f809d0b67059cb8e912885d48a824","narrativeSource":"4b21d6beb743f1cd91fc18ccb38135012f4b35dd9fcf703dd46b9c08a5caf48c","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Father Conmee boards the Dollymount tram at Newcomen Bridge.","it":"Padre Conmee sale sul tram per Dollymount al Newcomen Bridge.","fr":"Le père Conmee prend le tramway de Dollymount à Newcomen Bridge.","es":"El padre Conmee toma el tranvía de Dollymount en Newcomen Bridge."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"ocbridge","collection":"core","name":"O’Connell Bridge","noteHash":"56a2a78ee3784a18a5a91cbd7244f1fb","positionSource":"05bde2f3f459b41ebf463389de962a1f60bb3e36fb8641ac7306324dfafc8c86","narrativeSource":"72683abf20852d6129ab3a4857b1cfd82b529207b0d27c537f2cdbad0627a52c","description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"The procession crosses O’Connell Bridge; later Bloom watches the Liffey from the bridge.","it":"Il corteo attraversa l’O’Connell Bridge; più tardi Bloom osserva il Liffey dal ponte.","fr":"Le cortège traverse O’Connell Bridge ; plus tard, Bloom observe la Liffey depuis le pont.","es":"El cortejo cruza O’Connell Bridge; más tarde Bloom observa el Liffey desde el puente."}}},{"book":"ulisse","id":"orourke","collection":"core","name":"Larry O’Rourke’s pub","noteHash":"81d21d0c0eaa9d2c37f0fb13fe7f0d96","positionSource":"8a0b56735d8a1b538beb6e69014bf783bbef23bd6c4e65644748ab53866ef313","narrativeSource":"1c37c18296b58d8899350c1aa87381d1a63002ac1a